'''Solo''' was the unofficial name of the [[Dwarf star|micro-star]] [[Hyperspace|hyperspatial]] singularity that was created when the planet [[Ilum]] imploded during the [[First Order-Resistance War|war]] between the [[First Order]] and the [[Resistance]]. It was named after [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebellion]] hero [[Han Solo]], who was killed by his son, [[Ben Solo|Kylo Ren]] during the [[Battle of Starkiller Base]], which resulted in the star's formation.<ref name="TROS VD" />

